/-- **Exercise 8.25 (Scott 1981, PRG-19): `𝒟 ⊴ 𝒟^∞`**, for every `𝒟`. Specialized to `𝒟 = 𝒰` this is
Scott's remark `𝒰 ⊴ 𝒰^∞`. -/
