instantiation: de-interleave `δ'` (via (c)(1)), rewrite both `genAtom`s at the odd depth
`2 * n + 1` down to the `X`-sub-step's own two sides (`(xStep … (deinterleaveδ δ' n).1).1`/`.2`) via
