/-- **`hcore`**, code-level analogue of `Exercise812c.lean`'s `hcore`, final assembly: for any
`δ' : ℕ → Bool` and any `n`, `genAtom combinedXCode δ' n = ∅ ↔ genAtom combinedYCode δ' n = ∅` — the
