/-- **Currying (Theorem 3.12), as a domain isomorphism.** `(𝒟₀ × 𝒟₁ → 𝒟₂) ≅ (𝒟₀ → (𝒟₁ → 𝒟₂))`. -/
theorem curry_isomorphic (V₀ : NeighborhoodSystem α) (V₁ : NeighborhoodSystem β)
    (V₂ : NeighborhoodSystem γ) :
