/-- **`Fix(subU) ≃o Fix(subApprox)`.** Forward: `w ↦ j_→(w)`; backward: `φ ↦ i_→(φ)`. Needs only
`j_→∘i_→ = I` (no inequality on `i_→∘j_→`). -/
